  "description": "Dremel 48-Piece 1/4\" Sanding Band Kit, Includes 60, 120, and 240 Grit Options, Compatible with Dremel Rotary Tools (770B-01) - Distributed/Packaged by Dremel. Product Details: Boost your crafting and repair capabilities with the 770B-01 1/4\" (12.7mm) Sanding Band Variety Kit, featuring 48 versatile sanding bands in three distinct grit levels. This comprehensive set is an economical way to ensure you're prepared for diverse tasks, making it ideal for both seasoned craftsmen and hobbyists. Each band is designed to fit all Dremel rotary tools seamlessly.Experience the benefits of different grits: coarser bands swiftly strip and shape materials, while finer bands achieve smooth, polished finishes. These bands are effective on materials like hardwood, softwood, plastic, and aluminum, and are robust enough for tasks such as rust removal from steel and shaping rubber.Each sanding band is easily replaceable and can be swiftly swapped using the 430 Sanding Drum Mandrel, facilitating smooth transitions across different project stages. This set not only broadens the capabilities of your Dremel tool but also supplies you with a variety of grits to tackle any project with confidence.",
